### Chain Workflow
POST http://localhost:8091/api/agents/chain
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "input": "为客户支持功能整理需求",
  "steps": [
    "提取验收条件",
    "生成面向用户的摘要"
  ]
}

### Parallelization Workflow
POST http://localhost:8091/api/agents/parallel
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "input": "分析市场变化的影响",
  "perspectives": [
    "客户视角",
    "员工视角",
    "投资者视角"
  ]
}

